# ==============================================================================
# ColabHive — Docker Build Context Exclusions (`.dockerignore`)
# ==============================================================================
# Prevents local SQLite vaults, `.env` secrets, prebuilt binaries, and
# `node_modules` from leaking into Docker build context or image layers.

.git
.github
bin/
data/
runs/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.db-journal
*.chvault
.env*

web/node_modules
web/dist

sdk/python/build
sdk/python/dist
sdk/python/*.egg-info
sdk/python/src/*.egg-info
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache
